---
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/legal-layout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  canonicalPath="/terms"
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms governing access to and use of the Docita clinic management platform."
  lastUpdated="November 26, 2025"
>
  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      By using Docita, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, do not
      use the service. These terms apply to healthcare providers, clinic teams,
      and authorized users of a clinic account.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">2. Service Scope</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Docita provides software for appointment operations, clinical records,
      billing workflows, and patient communications. Product capabilities may
      evolve over time.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">3. Account Responsibilities</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>Provide accurate account information and keep credentials secure.</li>
      <li>Use the service in compliance with healthcare and privacy obligations.</li>
      <li>Ensure authorized use within your clinic and role boundaries.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">4. Billing and Subscriptions</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Paid plans are billed in advance according to selected cycle and plan.
      Pricing and feature details are published on our pricing page and may
      change with prior notice.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">5. Data Ownership</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Your clinic retains ownership of its operational and patient data. You
      grant us a limited right to process data solely to provide, secure, and
      improve the service.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">6. Limitation and Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      The service is provided on an as-available basis subject to applicable
      law. For legal questions about these terms, contact
      <a class="ml-1 text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:admin@docita.work">admin@docita.work</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
